    "incident" : "E17 stops after 35-50 minutes warm-up, restarts after cooling; permitted cleaning did not resolve three recurrences. No smoke, unusual odor or damaged guard reported.",
    "comparisonRequirements" : {
      "caseId" : "case-java-e0bd6a9a4c4a4337a878c48344bc96e4",
      "assetId" : "NB-P240-017",
      "scope" : "Compare every checked candidate and supported combination, including expedited plus loaner and standard plus loaner. Distinguish constituent evidence and arithmetic totals from a separately issued combined quote. Do not assume any combined reservation, installation quote, setup commitment, or coverage.",
      "operatingEvaluation" : "Evaluate capacity against 18 per minute, production start at 06:00 on September 30, the two-hour recoverable delay, shipment exposure, access and setup dependencies, conditional costs, and unresolved restoration risk. Standard attendance begins after the recoverable-delay window. Expedited resource work estimate is 2–4 hours, whereas the quoted repair scope is two hours; assess possible access beyond 18:00 and additional scope without equating investigation with chargeable repair labor. Loaner arrival is outside normal access and requires delivery, compatibility and setup confirmation before productive use.",
      "evidenceEvaluation" : "Use the complete source evidence and assessment below. Entitlements reports maintenanceRecordAvailable true, but the assessment says the complete maintenance record is unavailable; preserve the distinction and unresolved completeness rather than treating the returned flag as proof of a complete history. P240-B resources and prior S17-B replacement do not independently verify the asset's model, revision, serial eligibility, or site compatibility.",
      "amounts" : "Preserve all authoritative amounts and conditional branches exactly. Rates and price fields are supplied as authoritative numeric amounts; retain their raw values and USD currency when presenting any interpretation. Included diagnosis and travel must not be added as chargeable repair. The expedited premium remains payable when expedited attendance occurs even if unresolved. Coverage remains PENDING, with no coveredItems confirmed. Work beyond quoted scope/cap requires a new quote and approval. Replacement installation is not quoted, and loaner setup costs or commitments are not supplied.",
      "output" : "Own a cited recommendation and selectedOption, compare all checked candidates and supported combinations, identify outstanding evidence and decisions with responsible next parties, and preserve uncertainty. Distinguish recommendation from authorization, service-request submission, dispatch confirmation, booking, coverage confirmation, diagnosis, resource commitment, and return-to-service clearance. Do not invent probabilities or downtime prices. Return the complete comparison result with caseId and assetId so it can be preserved verbatim."
    },
    "serviceHistory" : {
      "caseId" : "case-java-e0bd6a9a4c4a4337a878c48344bc96e4",
      "revision" : "1",
      "kind" : "serviceHistory",
      "data" : [ {
        "id" : "WO-0820",
        "revision" : "1",
